events' AND 'get_recent_similar_alerts' to understand host context.\", \"tool_integration\": [\"get_recent_events\", \"get_recent_similar_alerts\"], \"logic\": \"Determine if the host has a history of similar volume spikes or communication with this root domain.\"}, {\"step_id\": 6, \"task\": \"Final Correlation and Triage Decision\", \"action\": \"Evaluate the normalized domain age, decoded payload results, and the endpoint's role.\", \"logic\": \"Classification rules:\\n\\n1. **Low Priority (LP)** if:\\n   - The root domain is verified infrastructure.\\n   - AND the subdomains match known patterns (e.g., DNSSEC sentinel).\\n\\n2. **High Priority (HP)** if:\\n   - **Decoded payloads contain sensitive host data.**\\n   - OR the root domain is newly registered (< 30 days).\"}]}\nAlert: {\"alert_id\": \"SOC-10243\", \"alert_name\": \"DNS Tunneling Anomaly\", \"start_time\": \"2026-01-16T16:51:45.000Z\", \"source_ip\": \"10.150.22.41\", \"destination_ip\": \"158.20.144.11\", \"endpoint\": \"dc-prod-02\", \"description\": \"An anomalously large amount (574 Bytes) of tunneled, high-entropy traffic through DNS (domain: dotnxdomain.net) was observed.\", \"evidence\": {\"workload\": \"Network\", \"application\": \"DNS\", \"query_type\": \"A\", \"actual_bytes\": 574, \"typical_bytes\": 28, \"sample_queries\": [\"root-key-sentinel-is-ta-42911.0ds-u9b22a1f-d12-c90-s1768557820.eu.dotnxdomain.net\", \"0du-v7a33b2c-e55-f81-s1768557820-i9ccba1bc-0.eu.dotnxdomain.net\", \"04u-w1d88e4f-g22-h33-s1768557820-j0ddfe1bc-0.eu.dotnxdomain.net\", \"nseu.dotnxdomain.net\", \"rs.dotnxdomain.net\"]}}"
  }
