    "content": "Playbook: {\"playbook_name\": \"Azure Network Security Group Modification Triage\", \"description\": \"Standard Operating Procedure (SOP) for investigating changes to Azure NSGs by evaluating environment criticality, identity legitimacy, temporal alignment, and geolocation validity.\", \"steps\": [{\"step_id\": 1, \"task\": \"Extract Resource and Identity Context\", \"action\": \"Identify the target NSG from 'evidence.resource_id' and the actor from the 'claims'.\", \"requirement\": \"Check if 'request_body' exists. IF MISSING: Rely on 'operationName' and 'resource_id'. If 'request_body' is present, it is the primary source for rule delta analysis.\"}, {\"step_id\": 2, \"task\": \"User Profile and Role Verification\", \"action\": \"INVOKE 'lookup_users' using the UPN found in the alert\", \"tool_integration\": [\"lookup_users\"], \"logic\": \"Verify if the user's job title is consistent with infrastructure changes. If the user is found but their role is unrelated, escalate to High Priority (HP).\"}, {\"step_id\": 3, \"task\": \"Temporal Context and Working Hours Analysis\", \"action\": \"Identify 'start_time' (UTC) and convert to local time (Estonian Time)\", \"logic\": \"1. **Time Conversion:** Convert UTC to EET (UTC+2) or EEST (UTC+3). \\n2. **Working Hours Check:** Evaluate if activity occurred within 08:00 - 19:00 Tallinn time.\\n3. **Classification:** Admin activity during these hours is an LP indicator. Activity outside these hours is suspicious (HP).\"}, {\"step_id\": 4, \"task\": \"Geolocation Verification\", \"action\": \"Inspect source geolocation.\", \"logic\": \"1. **Expected Location:** The default expected location for employees is Estonia (EE).\\n2. **Anomaly Detection:** If the activity originates from a foreign countryCode  without a recorded business travel profile, escalate to High Priority (HP).\"}, {\"step_id\": 5, \"task\": \"Environment Criticality Assessment\", \"action\": \"Analyze the Resource Group name for environment markers.\", \"logic\": \"1. **Production:** If the Resource Group contains '-prod-', '-core-', or '-baltic-', flag as potentially HP.\\n2. **Non-Production:** If it contains '-dev-', '-test-', or '-sandbox-', default toward LP unless the 'request_body' reveals sensitive port exposure.\"}, {\"step_id\": 6, \"task\": \"Rule Impact Analysis (Conditional)\", \"action\": \"IF 'request_body' is present, parse 'properties.securityRules'.\", \"logic\": \"1. **Bypass Check:** If a rule allows traffic on ports 22, 3389, or 445 from source '*' or 'Internet', escalate to HP.\\n2. **Hardening Check:** Adding 'Deny' rules (e.g., 'SanctionBlocks') is mostly an LP indicator.\"}, {\"step_id\": 7, \"task\": \"Correlate with Deployment Activity\", \"action\": \"INVOKE 'get_recent_events' and 'get_recent_similar_alerts' for the 'resource_id'.\", \"tool_integration\": [\"get_recent_events\", \"get_recent_similar_alerts\"], \"logic\": \"Determine if this change correlates with an approved action or deployment window. Approved correlations support LP classification.\"}, {\"step_id\": 8, \"task\": \"Final Triage and Classification\", \"action\": \"Evaluate the combination of user role, time, location, and environment.\", \"logic\": \"Classification rules:\\n\\n1. **Low Priority (LP)** if:\\n   - User is a verified Admin AND within Estonian working hours AND from an Estonian or known IP.\\n   - OR the change is clearly for hardening.\\n\\n2. **High Priority (HP)** if:\\n   - **The activity is from an unexpected Geolocation (Outside EE).**\\n   - OR activity is outside working hours (08:00 - 19:00).\\n   - OR sensitive ports are opened to the Internet.\"}]}\nAlert: {\"alert_id\": \"SOC-99200\", \"alert_name\": \"Azure Network Security Modification\", \"start_time\": \"2026-02-10T09:15:00.000Z\", \"description\": \"A suspicious Azure activity was detected. This detection was triggered by a rule with the following description:\\\"Identifies when a network security configuration is modified or deleted.\\\"\", \"evidence\": {\"principalId\": \"m1w2b3b4-c5d6-4a7b-8c9d-0e1f2a3b4c5d\", \"principalType\": \"User\", \"role\": \"Contributor\", \"roleAssignmentId\": \"7a6b5c4d-3e2f-1a0b-9c8d-7e6f5a4b3c2d\", \"roleAssignmentScope\": \"/subscriptions/228e1d3b-9311-4477-8c1d-112233445566\", \"roleDefinitionId\": \"8e3af657a8ff443ca75c2fe8c4bcb635\", \"scope\": \"/subscriptions/228e1d3b-9311-4477-8c1d-112233445566/resourceGroups/rg-baltic-prod-connectivity/providers/Microsoft.Network/networkSecurityGroups/nsg-prod-core\", \"operationName\": \"MICROSOFT.NETWORK/NETWORKSECURITYGROUPS/WRITE\", \"correlationId\": \"e1f2a3b4-c5d6-7e8f-9g0h-1i2j3k4l5m6n\", \"resultSignature\": \"Succeeded\", \"caller_ip\": \"194.126.101.99\", \"caller_ip_geo\": {\"city\": \"Tallinn\", \"countryCode\": \"EE\", \"countryName\": \"Estonia\", \"region\": \"Harju County\"}, \"claims\": {\"http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2005/05/identity/claims/name\": \"marcus.webb@globalcorp.ee\", \"http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2005/05/identity/claims/upn\": \"marcus.webb@globalcorp.ee\", \"http://schemas.microsoft.com/claims/authnmethodsreferences\": \"pwd,mfa\", \"http://schemas.microsoft.com/identity/claims/tenantid\": \"d1c2b3a4-e5f6-7a8b-9c0d-1e2f3a4b5c6d\", \"ipaddr\": \"194.126.101.99\", \"name\": \"Marcus Webb\"}, \"request_body\": \"{\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"securityRules\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Test\\\",\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"access\\\":\\\"Allow\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Temporary access for review\\\",\\\"destinationAddressPrefix\\\":\\\"*\\\",\\\"destinationPortRange\\\":\\\"3389\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Inbound\\\",\\\"priority\\\":110,\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"Tcp\\\",\\\"sourceAddressPrefix\\\":\\\"*\\\"}}]}}\"}}"
