kers.\", \"logic\": \"1. **Production:** If the Resource Group contains '-prod-', '-core-', or '-baltic-', flag as potentially HP.\\n2. **Non-Production:** If it contains '-dev-', '-test-', or '-sandbox-', default toward LP unless the 'request_body' reveals sensitive port exposure.\"}, {\"step_id\": 6, \"task\": \"Rule Impact Analysis (Conditional)\", \"action\": \"IF 'request_body' is present, parse 'properties.securityRules'.\", \"logic\": \"1. **Bypass Check:** If a rule allows traffic on ports 22, 3389, or 445 from source '*' or 'Internet', escalate to HP.\\n2. **Hardening Check:** Adding 'Deny' rules (e.g., 'SanctionBlocks') is mostly an LP indicator.\"}, {\"step_id\": 7, \"task\": \"Correlate with Deployment Activity\", \"action\": \"INVOKE 'get_recent_events' and 'get_recent_similar_alerts' for the 'resource_id'.\", \"tool_integration\": [\"get_recent_events\", \"get_recent_similar_alerts\"], \"logic\": \"Determine if this change correlates with an approved action or deployment window. Approved correlations support LP classification.\"}, {\"step_id\": 8, \"task\": \"Final Triage and Classification\", \"action\": \"Evaluate the combination of user role, time, location, and environment.\", \"logic\": \"Classification rules:\\n\\n1. **Low Priority (LP)** if:\\n   - User is a verified Admin AND within Estonian working hours AND from an Estonian or known IP.\\n   - OR the change is clearly for hardening.\\n\\n2. **High Priority (HP)** if:\\n   - **The activity is from an unexpected Geolocation (Outside EE).**\\n   - OR activity is outside working hours (08:00 - 19:00).\\n   - OR sensitive ports are opened to the Internet.\"}]}\nAlert: {\"alert_id\": \"SOC-22410\", \"alert_name\": \"Azure Network Security Modification\", \"start_time\": \"2026-02-10T21:50:45.000Z\", \"description\": \"A suspicious Azure activity was detected. This detection was triggered by a rule with the following description:\\\"Identifies when a network security configuration is modified or deleted.\\\"\", \"evidence\": {\"workload\": \"Microsoft.Network\", \"operation\": \"MICROSOFT.NETWORK/NETWORKSECURITYGROUPS/WRITE\", \"resource_id\": \"/subscriptions/d1c2b3a4-e5f6-7a8b-9c0d-1e2f3a4b5c6d/resourceGroups/rg-nordic-dev-test/providers/Microsoft.Network/networkSecurityGroups/nsg-aks-dev-01\", \"correlation_id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7a8b-9c0d-e1f2a3b4c5d6\", \"result\": \"Started\", \"geo_location\": {\"region\": \"North Europe\", \"stamp\": \"DB4\"}, \"authorization_details\": {\"principal_id\": \"b4a3c2d1-e5f6-4a7b-8c9d-0e1f2a3b4c5d\", \"principal_type\": \"ServicePrincipal\", \"role\": \"Contributor\", \"scope\": \"/subscriptions/d1c2b3a4-e5f6-7a8b-9c0d-1e2f3a4b5c6d/resourceGroups/rg-nordic-dev-test\"}, \"request_body\": \"{\\\"etag\\\":\\\"W/\\\\\\\"2b3c4d5e-6f7a-8b9c-0d1e-2f3a4b5c6d7e\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"/subscriptions/d1c2b3a4-e5f6-7a8b-9c0d-1e2f3a4b5c6d/resourceGroups/rg-nordic-dev-test/providers/Microsoft.Network/networkSecurityGroups/nsg-aks-dev-01\\\",\\\"location\\\":\\\"northeurope\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"nsg-aks-dev-01\\\",\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"securityRules\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"AllowDevWebService\\\",\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"access\\\":\\\"Allow\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Temporary Web Service for API Testing\\\",\\\"destinationAddressPrefix\\\":\\\"13.75.144.22\\\",\\\"destinationPortRange\\\":\\\"8080\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Inbound\\\",\\\"priority\\\":1010,\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"Tcp\\\",\\\"sourceAddressPrefix\\\":\\\"*\\\"}},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"AllowVnetInBound\\\",\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"access\\\":\\\"Allow\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Inbound\\\",\\\"priority\\\":65000,\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"*\\\"}}],\\\"provisioningState\\\":\\\"Succeeded\\\"}}\"}}"
