de  without a recorded business travel profile, escalate to High Priority (HP).\"}, {\"step_id\": 5, \"task\": \"Environment Criticality Assessment\", \"action\": \"Analyze the Resource Group name for environment markers.\", \"logic\": \"1. **Production:** Presence of '-prod-', '-core-', or '-baltic-' increases criticality but does not force HP if identity and time are valid.\\n 2. **Non-Production:** If it contains '-dev-', '-test-', or '-sandbox-', default toward LP unless the 'request_body' reveals sensitive port exposure.\"}, {\"step_id\": 6, \"task\": \"Rule Impact Analysis (Conditional)\", \"action\": \"IF 'request_body' is present, parse 'properties.securityRules'.\", \"logic\": \"1. **Bypass Check:** If a rule allows traffic on ports 22, 3389, or 445 from source '*' or 'Internet', escalate to HP.\\n2. **Hardening Check:** Adding 'Deny' rules (e.g., 'SanctionBlocks') is mostly an LP indicator.\"}, {\"step_id\": 7, \"task\": \"Correlate with Deployment Activity\", \"action\": \"MAKE SURE TO INVOKE 'get_recent_events' and 'get_recent_similar_alerts'.\", \"tool_integration\": [\"get_recent_events\", \"get_recent_similar_alerts\"], \"logic\": \"Determine if this change correlates with an approved action or deployment window. Approved correlations support LP classification.\"}, {\"step_id\": 8, \"task\": \"Final Triage and Classification\", \"action\": \"Evaluate the combination of user role, time, location, and environment.\", \"logic\": \"Classification rules:\\n\\n1. **Low Priority (LP)** if:\\n   - User job title matches the performed action AND within Estonian working hours AND from an Estonian or known IP.\\n   - OR the change is clearly for hardening purposes.\\n\\n2. **High Priority (HP)** if:\\n   - **The activity is from an unexpected Geolocation without any confirmation (Outside EE).**\\n   - OR activity is outside working hours (08:00 - 19:00).\\n   - OR sensitive ports are opened to the Internet.\"}]}\nAlert: {\"alert_id\": \"SOC-99400\", \"alert_name\": \"Azure Network Security Modification\", \"start_time\": \"2026-02-10T14:45:00.000Z\", \"description\": \"A suspicious Azure activity was detected. This detection was triggered by a rule with the following description:\\\"Identifies when a network security configuration is modified or deleted.\\\"\", \"evidence\": {\"principalId\": \"m1r2o3d4-z5u6-4a7b-8c9d-0e1f2a3b4c5d\", \"principalType\": \"User\", \"role\": \"Contributor\", \"roleAssignmentId\": \"9c8d7e6f-5a4b-3c2d-1e0f-9a8b7c6d5e4f\", \"roleAssignmentScope\": \"/subscriptions/228e1d3b-9311-4477-8c1d-112233445566\", \"roleDefinitionId\": \"b24988ac-6180-42a0-ab88-20f7382dd24c\", \"scope\": \"/subscriptions/228e1d3b-9311-4477-8c1d-112233445566/resourceGroups/rg-baltic-prod-connectivity/providers/Microsoft.Network/networkSecurityGroups/nsg-prod-edge-01\", \"operationName\": \"MICROSOFT.NETWORK/NETWORKSECURITYGROUPS/DELETE\", \"correlationId\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7a8b-9c0d-e1f2a3b4c5d6\", \"resultSignature\": \"Succeeded\", \"caller_ip\": \"186.155.12.88\", \"caller_ip_geo\": {\"city\": \"Bogot\\u00e1\", \"countryCode\": \"CO\", \"countryName\": \"Colombia\", \"region\": \"Bogot\\u00e1 D.C.\"}, \"claims\": {\"http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2005/05/identity/claims/name\": \"mateo.rodriguez@globalcorp.ee\", \"http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2005/05/identity/claims/upn\": \"mateo.rodriguez@globalcorp.ee\", \"http://schemas.microsoft.com/claims/authnmethodsreferences\": \"fido,mfa\", \"http://schemas.microsoft.com/identity/claims/tenantid\": \"d1c2b3a4-e5f6-7a8b-9c0d-1e2f3a4b5c6d\", \"ipaddr\": \"186.155.12.88\", \"name\": \"Mateo Rodriguez\"}}}"
