    "role": "user",
    "content": "Playbook: {\"playbook_name\": \"Visual Brand Abuse & Logo Triage\", \"description\": \"LLM-based SOP for evaluating potential logo abuse detections. Prioritizes differentiating between authorized partner usage (LP) and malicious brand impersonation (HP) using computer vision metadata, domain reputation, and visual intent analysis.\", \"steps\": [{\"step_id\": 1, \"task\": \"Extract Visual & Domain Metadata\", \"action\": \"Parse alert JSON for 'target_brand', 'matching_confidence', 'scanned_url', 'source_ip', 'domain_age', and 'screenshot_path'.\", \"logic\": \"Establishes the baseline. The core task is then to determine the context of that presence.\"}, {\"step_id\": 2, \"task\": \"Evaluate Domain Trust & Authority\", \"action\": \"Analyze 'domain_age' and 'registrar'. Check if the domain is a known partner, a subsidiary, or an industry-relevant entity.\", \"logic\": \"Established domains (age > 1 year) with transparent registrar data are significantly less likely to be hosting one-off phishing pages. New domains (< 30 days) are high-risk indicators.\"}, {\"step_id\": 3, \"task\": \"Analyze Visual Intent & Page Layout\", \"action\": \"Perform a comparative analysis of the attached webpage screenshot against the brand's official web presence. Inspect the image for high-risk elements: 1) Credential input fields, 2) Urgent security/account lures, 3) PII collection forms, or 4) Layout/CSS cloning. Manually verify if the 'scanned_url' in the browser address bar matches the visual branding.\", \"logic\": \"Authorized usage (LP) is typically evidenced by the logo appearing in partner galleries, footers, or press releases on established domains. Malicious intent (HP) is indicated if the screenshot shows a replica of the brand's login/portal interface hosted on an unauthorized or typosquatted domain.\"}, {\"step_id\": 4, \"task\": \"Cross-Reference with Authorized Usage List\", \"action\": \"MAKE SURE TO INVOKE 'get_recent_similar_alerts' and internal partner databases to verify if the 'scanned_url' or parent domain is a pre-approved third-party collaborator.\", \"tool_integration\": \"get_recent_similar_alerts\", \"logic\": \"Consistency in detection across the environment for a specific partner domain typically confirms a benign, persistent relationship (LP).\"}, {\"step_id\": 5, \"task\": \"Infrastructure & Hosting Reputation Check\", \"action\": \"MAKE SURE TO INVOKE 'check_ip_reputation' for the 'source_ip' associated with the scanned webpage.\", \"tool_integration\": \"check_ip_reputation\", \"logic\": \"IPs associated with known phishing bulletproof hosters or those with high abuse scores reinforce a malicious verdict. However, reputable cloud hosting (AWS, GCP) can be used by both legitimate partners and attackers.\"}, {\"step_id\": 6, \"task\": \"Final Triage Classification\", \"action\": \"Assign triage priority (LP or HP) by weighing domain age, visual intent, and infrastructure reputation.\", \"logic\": \"Classification rules:\\n\\n1. **Low Priority (LP)** if:\\n   - The logo appears on a long-standing, reputable domain (age > 1 year).\\n   - AND the context is non-interactive.\\n   - AND the page contains logos from multiple other legitimate brands in a similar professional context.\\n\\n2. **High Priority (HP)** if:\\n   - The logo is used on a newly registered or look-alike/typosquatted domain.\\n   - OR the page features a login portal, 'Security Warning', or data entry form requesting credentials/PII.\\n   - OR the page layout is a pixel-perfect clone of the brand's official landing page but hosted on an unauthorized domain.\\n   - OR 'check_ip_reputation' shows high sign of malicious rating.\"}, {\"step_id\": 7, \"task\": \"Generate Investigation Summary\", \"action\": \"Construct a concise Description field including: 1) Target brand matched, 2) Visual context (e.g., 'Partner Gallery' vs 'Fake Login'), 3) Domain risk level, and 4) Final reasoning.\", \"logic\": \"Ensures the summary clarifies if the alert was a false positive based on business context or an active brand threat.\"}]}\nAlert: {\"alert_id\": \"SOC-54389\", \"alert_name\": \"Brand Logo Detection\", \"threat\": \"LogoDetection:VitalisHealthcare\", \"category\": \"Brand Monitoring\", \"status\": \"new\", \"start_time\": \"2026-02-18T12:45:10.000Z\", \"description\": \"Vitalis Healthcare logo detected on apexwellness.com.\", \"evidence\": {\"detection_source\": \"Visual-AI-Scanner\", \"target_brand\": \"Vitalis Healthcare\", \"scanned_url\": \"https://www.apexwellness.com/partners\", \"source_ip\": \"104.21.44.11\", \"domain_age\": \"5 years\", \"registrar\": \"GoDaddy.com, LLC\"}}"
  }
