o but lacks any brand-specific text.\\n   **Note:** For all LP cases above, the registration date of the domain does not matter and should not trigger an HP classification if the visual intent is clearly non-malicious.\\n\\n2. **High Priority (HP)** if:\\n   - **Deceptive Intent:** The page is a pixel-perfect clone or uses branding to create a sense of urgency (e.g., 'Update Your Account', 'Security Alert').\\n   - **Credential/Data Harvesting:** The page features a login portal, MFA prompt, or data entry form requesting sensitive information (PII).\\n   - **Malicious Infrastructure:** The domain is newly registered (< 1 year) AND shows suspicious or deceptive content, is typosquatted, or 'check_ip_reputation' returns a high malicious score.\\n   - **Impersonation:** The site represents itself as the official brand but is hosted on unauthorized or suspicious infrastructure.\"}, {\"step_id\": 8, \"task\": \"Generate Investigation Summary\", \"action\": \"Construct a concise Description field including: 1) Target brand matched (whether it was actually detected correctly or not), 2) Visual context (e.g., 'Partner Gallery' vs 'Fake Login'), 3) Domain risk level, and 4) Final reasoning.\", \"logic\": \"Ensures the summary clarifies if the alert was a false positive based on business context or an active brand threat.\"}]}\nAlert: {\"alert_id\": \"SOC-55014\", \"alert_name\": \"Brand Logo Detection\", \"threat\": \"LogoDetection:VitalisHealthcare\", \"category\": \"Brand Monitoring\", \"status\": \"new\", \"start_time\": \"2026-02-18T15:40:12.000Z\", \"description\": \"Vitalis Healthcare logo detected on vitalis-connect-update.com.\", \"evidence\": {\"detection_source\": \"Logo-Scanner\", \"target_brand\": \"Vitalis Healthcare\", \"target_brand_domain\": \"vitalis.com\", \"scanned_url\": \"https://www.vitalis-connect-update.com/download/security-patch-v4\", \"domain_ip\": \"103.45.12.89\", \"domain_age\": \"3 hours\", \"registrar\": \"NameSilo, LLC\"}}"
      },
