confirms a pattern of benign hits from the source.\\n\\n2. **High Priority (HP)** if:\\n   - **High-Risk Infrastructure:** Found on a known dark web breach repository or anonymous 'dump' site.\\n   - **Sensitive Metadata/Title:** 'document_title' or 'relative_paths' contain terms like 'DB_Dump', 'Credentials', or 'Confidential'.\\n   - **Structured Data:** 'matched_content' (if present) shows client-specific PII/PHI.\"}, {\"step_id\": 9, \"task\": \"Generate Investigation Summary\", \"action\": \"Construct a concise summary based on available fields. Explicitly note if translation was required and if the verdict was reached via metadata context due to missing 'matched_content'.\", \"logic\": \"Ensures the analyst understands the evidentiary limitations and the reasoning for the risk level assigned.\"}]}\nAlert: {\"alert_id\": \"SOC-75925\", \"alert_name\": \"Brand Mention in External Document\", \"threat\": \"DocumentExposure:VitalisHealthcare\", \"category\": \"Brand Monitoring\", \"status\": \"new\", \"start_time\": \"2026-02-19T19:30:12.000Z\", \"description\": \"Vitalis Healthcare mentioned in a potentially leaked document.\", \"evidence\": {\"detection_source\": \"TI-Monitor-Scribd\", \"document_title\": \"Vitalis_Staff_Directory_and_System_Roles_Q1.xlsx\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.scribd.com/document/7721543/vitalis-staff-roles-2026\", \"matched_content\": \"...The following Vitalis Healthcare personnel have been granted Elevated Privileges for the 2026 fiscal year. [Admin] Sarah Jenkins (s.jenkins@vitalis.com) - Full access to PHI/EMR databases. [DevOps] Mark Thompson (m.thompson@vitalis.com) - Access to production AWS buckets and CI/CD pipelines. [HR] Elena Rodriguez - Access to payroll and PII. All users must confirm they have reviewed the internal security handling procedures for sensitive Vitalis Healthcare data...\"}}"
