        "text": "Playbook: {\"playbook_name\": \"Excessive Download Triage\", \"description\": \"SOP for triaging data exfiltration or bulk download anomalies. Focuses on geolocation validation, user role correlation, file sensitivity, and temporal (time-based) anomalies.\", \"steps\": [{\"step_id\": 1, \"task\": \"Extract Alert Metadata & Evidence\", \"action\": \"Parse alert JSON for 'user', 'source_ip', 'user_agent', 'workload', 'sample_files', 'sample_paths', 'start_time', and 'geo_location'.\", \"logic\": \"Establishes the scope of the activity and provides the UTC timestamp needed for temporal analysis.\"}, {\"step_id\": 2, \"task\": \"Geographic & Temporal Context Validation\", \"action\": \"Evaluate 'geo_location' and convert 'start_time' (UTC) to the local time of that geo-location.\", \"logic\": \"Assess if the activity occurred during local business hours (08:00-19:00). Activity between 00:00 and 05:00 local time is considered high-risk regardless of role, as it can suggest automated scraping or an attacker operating from a different time zone.\"}, {\"step_id\": 3, \"task\": \"User Role & Identity Correlation\", \"action\": \"MAKE SURE TO INVOKE 'lookup_users' using the 'user' provided in the alert.\", \"tool_integration\": \"lookup_users\", \"logic\": \"Compare the user's job title/department with the 'sample_paths' to check for access legitimacy.\"}, {\"step_id\": 4, \"task\": \"Historical & Environmental Correlation\", \"action\": \"MAKE SURE TO INVOKE 'get_recent_events' and 'get_recent_similar_alerts' to understand context.\", \"tool_integration\": [\"get_recent_events\", \"get_recent_similar_alerts\"], \"logic\": \"Look for malicious patterns which, combined with bulk downloads, escalate the priority immediately.\"}, {\"step_id\": 5, \"task\": \"User-Agent & Application Analysis\", \"action\": \"Examine 'user_agent' and 'application' to identify the access method (Browser vs. Script).\", \"logic\": \"Automated tools like 'Python-requests' or 'curl' used on sensitive paths are likely suspicious indicators.\"}, {\"step_id\": 6, \"task\": \"Final Triage Classification\", \"action\": \"Assign triage priority (LP or HP) based on role, location, time, and volume.\", \"logic\": \"Classification rules:\\n\\n1. **Low Priority (LP)** if:\\n   - Geolocation is within Europe and occurs during typical business hours.\\n   - AND role matches data sensitivity.\\n   - OR history shows this is a recurring monthly sync.\\n\\n2. **High Priority (HP)** if:\\n   - Activity occurs during 'Dead of Night' (e.g., 01:00 - 05:00) local time without prior history of night shifts.\\n   - OR Geolocation is anomalous/outside Europe.\\n   - OR there is a significant role-to-data mismatch.\\n   - OR the download volume is 20x higher than the baseline.\"}, {\"step_id\": 7, \"task\": \"Generate Investigation Summary\", \"action\": \"Construct a summary including: 1) User role vs. data sensitivity, 2) Geolocation status, 3) Correlation with recent alerts, and 4) Final priority reasoning.\", \"logic\": \"Provides a clear narrative for SOC analysts to decide on client notification, further investigation or no action.\"}]}\nAlert: {\"alert_id\": \"SOC-12200\", \"alert_name\": \"Data Exfiltration Anomaly\", \"start_time\": \"2026-01-31T14:45:10.000Z\", \"source_ip\": \"194.126.101.99\", \"destination_ip\": \"40.108.201.15\", \"endpoint\": \"WKSTN-OFFSITE-04\", \"user\": \"Liam.O-Sullivan@globalcorp.ee\", \"user_id\": \"b11d99a4-e55c-4a12-b9a1-4f8c2d1f9a7b\", \"description\": \"An unusual volume of SharePoint file downloads (850) was observed from the user, which is higher than their 24-hour baseline.\", \"evidence\": {\"workload\": \"SharePoint\", \"operation\": \"FileDownloaded\", \"site_url\": \"https://globalcorp.sharepoint.com/sites/Executive_Board_Confidential/\", \"application\": \"Office 365 SharePoint Online\", \"user_agent\": \"Mozilla/4.0 (compatible; Win32; WinHttp.WinHttpRequest.5)\", \"file_count\": 850, \"baseline_24h\": 5, \"geo_location\": {\"city\": \"Tallinn\", \"country\": \"Estonia\"}, \"sample_files\": [\"Project_Zeus_Merger_Terms_v4.pdf\", \"Q1_Shareholder_Divestment_Plan.xlsx\", \"Board_Meeting_Minutes_January.docx\"], \"sample_paths\": [\"Shared Documents/Strategy/Acquisitions/Zeus/\", \"Shared Documents/Finance/Shareholder_Relations/\", \"Shared Documents/Executive/Board_Minutes/\"]}}"
